{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（13日）中午12時許，尖沙咀麼地道34號一間找換店的職員報案，指收到多包可疑白色粉末。</p><p>找換店的郵箱在旁邊大廈電梯大堂，警方初步調查懷疑白色粉末是毒品，案件列販毒，正點算數量及追查來源。</p><figure><img alt=\"找換店在大廈內的郵箱被人放入毒品。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260813/1164559793239625728409735.jpeg/rIrOArXsWp1fdLimcJNJjcR7rvreVKhMu82nfp7Np34\"/><figcaption>找換店在大廈內的郵箱被人放入毒品。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"找換店的郵箱在大廈地下大堂。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260813/1164561384650838016217804.jpeg/SPgviPt06fbvLBM9Y3a3CKftBj2V5s65EDjPuTU4z7k\"/><figcaption>找換店的郵箱在大廈地下大堂。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"找換店的郵箱在大廈地下大堂。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260813/1164561387301769216468293.jpeg/nMMKWe4msGhIzsCFky7koyyg4RgutqpdQhpox2caaMc\"/><figcaption>找換店的郵箱在大廈地下大堂。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"找換店的郵箱在大廈地下大堂，警方封鎖調查。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260813/1164561389797511168827365.jpeg/jz8kQDnFTAzdEET45p3fPxYd5DbMsbVchV1SbKBdUmw\"/><figcaption>找換店的郵箱在大廈地下大堂，警方封鎖調查。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"找換店收到毒品郵件。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260813/1164561392272281600591248.jpeg/lnawvcLXTRu5Ia1kFk23vrjEQpaH1IviWaAjHHygIxw\"/><figcaption>找換店收到毒品郵件。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-13T05:40:22.038469+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":207,"images":5,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}